        "original_id": "d364d925-78d4-598d-ac87-84b6a6e1e0d7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Laura Esquivel, Howard Fast\n- Works: Like Water for Chocolate\n- Roles: novelist, screenwriter, politician, television writer\n- Organizations: Chamber of Deputies, Morena Party\n- Topics: pen names\n\nFacts:\n- Howard Fast was born on November 11, 1914, and he was an American novelist and television writer.\n- Laura Esquivel was born on September 30, 1950, and she is a Mexican novelist, screenwriter, and politician.\n- Laura Esquivel published the novel Like Water for Chocolate in 1989.\n- Like Water for Chocolate is also known by its Spanish title, Como agua para chocolate.\n- Howard Fast also wrote under the pen names E. V. Cunningham and Walter Ericson.\n- Laura Esquivel served in the Chamber of Deputies from 2012 to 2018 for the Morena Party.\n- Howard Fast died on March 12, 2003.",
